== Walkthrough ==

The Kerran Sha`rr has sensed that something is amiss in Kerra Isle. The trouble seems to stem from the small island south of the village. He has asked you to investigate the situation on the island and report back.

Please note that you ''must'' use the task system for this quest; you cannot hand in multiples of each quest item. However, you can ''collect'' multiples of each quest item beforehand and then go through the quest steps repeatedly.

The Kerran Sha`rr is located at 902.55, 347.27, -6.81, in the basement of the building in the northwest corner of [[Kerra Island]].

Following from the end of the previous quest, [[Something is Wrrrong]]... 

''' You have been assigned the task 'This Means Warrr'. '''

: The Kerran Sha`rr says, 'Herrresy! No disciple of Kejaarrr would do such a thing! And even the pumas of the isle have turrrned on us, you say? I must ask yourrr aid once again. The danger is grrreat. Make any necessarrry prrreparrrations, and then storrrm the tigerrr trrraining pit on the south end of that once sacrrred island. Do not rrreturrrn until you have rrrouted what evil has taken rrroot. I fearrr anything less could mean the dawn of a new warrr.'

=== Step 1 ===
* Slay one of the Heretics at the Tiger Training Pits and collect their orders.
* The Kerran Sha`rr has sent you to deal with the threat directly. <br> Travel to the tiger pits of the island and eliminate one of the leaders of the heretic forces.

Head to the island in the south side of the zone. Its southwest corner has a platform surrounded by tigers, and you can find the [[kerran tiger spahi]] in the center there. Kill it and loot the [[Heretic Insurrection Orders]]. 

'''Your task 'This Means Warrr' bas been updated.'''

=== Step 2 ===
* Show the Heretic's orders to the Kerran Sha`rr
* The Kerran Sha'rr has sent you to deal with the threat directly. <br> Loot the Heretic Insurrection Orders.

Go back to [[The Kerran Sha`rr]] and give them the [[Heretic Insurrection Orders]].

'''Your task 'This Means Warrr' has been updated.'''
'''You've dealt a blow to the Heretics attempting to seize control of Kerra Isle, but they're sure to return in time.'''

<div class="facblock">
* Your faction standing with [[Kerra Isle]] has been adjusted by 20.
</div>
{{YouGainExperience}}

'''You receive [[Talisman of Kejaar Kerrath]].'''

: The Kerran Sha`rr says, 'So it rrreally was herrretics on Kerran lands. I fearrred as much. We have enjoyed an age of peace, but apparrrently someone in this village has rrreason to see it end.'

== Farming the Talisman ==

The Talisman is the only item in the game that currently increases hit point, mana, and endurance regen. This makes it a highly sought after item to acquire and upgrade. 

The easiest way to do this is to go to the island and farm the [[Desecrated Kejaar Totem]] from the [[a kerran `amir|kerran `amirs]] and the [[Heretic Insurrection Orders]] from the [[kerran tiger spahi]]. Collect a bunch of each and then run to [[The Kerran Sha`rr]]. 

You can then talk to the Sha`rr to activate [[Something is Wrrrong]], turn in one of the totems, which will activate [[This Means Warrr]], then turn in the orders for the Talisman.  Do this over and over to hand in all the quest items you retrieved and avoid running back and forth for every turn in.

